## Phase 2: Go Backend — New API Handlers & Routes

> [!NOTE]
> Module structure: each domain gets its own `handlers/` file and routes group.

### New Handler Files (backend)

| File | Routes |
|---|---|
| `handlers/student.go` | GET/PUT `/api/students`, GET `/api/students/:id`, PUT `/api/students/:id/attendance`, GET `/api/students/:id/report` |
| `handlers/canteen.go` | CRUD `/api/canteen/menu`, POST `/api/canteen/orders`, GET `/api/canteen/orders`, PUT `/api/canteen/orders/:id/status`, GET `/api/canteen/wallet/:userId`, POST `/api/canteen/wallet/recharge` |
| `handlers/assignments.go` | CRUD `/api/assignments`, POST `/api/assignments/:id/submit`, PUT `/api/assignments/submissions/:id/grade` |
| `handlers/timetable.go` | GET `/api/timetable/:section`, POST `/api/timetable` (admin/HOD only) |
| `handlers/leaves.go` | POST `/api/leaves`, GET `/api/leaves`, PUT `/api/leaves/:id/approve`, PUT `/api/leaves/:id/reject` |
| `handlers/attendance.go` | POST `/api/attendance/mark` (bulk), GET `/api/attendance/:studentId`, GET `/api/attendance/report/:section` |
| `handlers/fees.go` | GET `/api/fees/:studentId`, POST `/api/fees/payment`, GET `/api/fees/report` |
| `handlers/transport.go` | CRUD `/api/transport/routes`, GET `/api/transport/student/:id` |
| `handlers/library.go` | GET `/api/library/:studentId`, POST `/api/library/issue`, PUT `/api/library/return/:id` |
| `handlers/hostel.go` | GET `/api/hostel/rooms`, PUT `/api/hostel/rooms/:id/assign`, CRUD `/api/hostel/passes`, CRUD `/api/hostel/complaints` |
| `handlers/announcements.go` | CRUD `/api/announcements`, GET `/api/announcements?role=student&section=CS-A` |

### Frontend API Layer — New `lib/api.ts`
Replace all `getUsers()`/`saveUsers()` `localStorage` calls with `fetch()` calls to the Go backend. Use Next.js `SERVER_URL` env variable.

