## Execution Order

| Step | Work Item | Complexity |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Extend GORM models + run migrations | Medium |
| 2 | Build all Go API handlers | High |
| 3 | Create `lib/api.ts` (frontend API layer) | Medium |
| 4 | Build Canteen Admin portal (`/dashboard/canteen`) | High |
| 5 | Expand Student dashboard (4 new tabs) | High |
| 6 | Expand Parent dashboard (4 new tabs) | Medium |
| 7 | Expand Teacher dashboard (assignments + bulk attendance) | High |
| 8 | Expand Admin dashboard (HR + transport + timetable) | High |
| 9 | Expand HOD dashboard | Medium |
| 10 | Expand Warden dashboard | Medium |
| 11 | Wire Canteen flow end-to-end (student → admin) | High |
| 12 | Final build verification + seed data | Low |

